# Web3Forms access key — powers the "Send my selections" and "Send shortlist" buttons.
# Submissions are delivered to whichever inbox the key is registered to.
#
# One-time setup (Kristine):
#   1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter kristine@thetechslp.com as the destination.
#   2. Web3Forms emails an access key to that address — copy it.
#   3. Local dev: copy this file to ".env.local" and paste the key below.
#   4. Production (Render): set VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY in the design-center service env vars,
#      then trigger a deploy (Vite inlines the value at build time).
#
# Until a key is set, the Send buttons gracefully fall back to opening the client's
# email app pre-addressed to kristine@thetechslp.com.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
